                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "Data of three studies reported in the above manuscript. All datafiles are provided in MLWIN/WSZ-format and in SPSS-file (Dataverse does not support MLWIN/WSZ-files but the data were analyzed in this program rather than in SPSS).  For each study (1, 2, 3) two datafiles are uploaded, one for the accuracy scores and one for the reaction times. An Excel-file with information about the stimulus materials (e.g., word frequency of the manipulated words) has also been uploaded."
